---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { videos } from '../data/content';
---

<Layout currentPath="/youtube" title="YouTube — Przeprogramowani" description="Filmy Przeprogramowanych o AI, frontendzie, TypeScripcie i rozwoju w branży IT.">
  <main>
    <section class="grid-lines border-b hairline py-24 sm:py-32">
      <div class="site-container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.8fr] lg:items-end lg:gap-20"><div><div class="eyebrow">Kanał dla ciekawych</div><h1 class="display mt-7 max-w-4xl text-[clamp(3.7rem,8vw,7.5rem)] font-medium leading-[.86]">O technologii <span class="text-lime">bez filtra.</span></h1></div><div><p class="max-w-md text-lg leading-8 text-mist">Nowości ze świata IT, praktyczne workflow i rozmowy o tym, jak kierować swoją karierą w najlepszy dla siebie sposób.</p><a class="link-arrow mt-8 text-lime" href="https://www.youtube.com/@przeprogramowani" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Odwiedź kanał <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="site-container py-24 sm:py-32">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.25fr_.75fr] lg:gap-16">
        <a class="group relative overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-panel" href={`https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=${videos[0].id}`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><div class="relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-[#182019]"><img class="h-full w-full object-cover opacity-85 transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-100" src={`https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${videos[0].id}/maxresdefault.jpg`} alt={videos[0].title} /><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><span class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-full bg-lime text-ink transition-transform group-hover:scale-110"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="ml-0.5 h-5 w-5"><path d="m8 5 11 7-11 7V5Z"/></svg></span><span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 bg-ink/80 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-cream">{videos[0].duration}</span></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-lime">{videos[0].category} · {videos[0].date}</p><h2 class="display mt-3 max-w-2xl text-3xl leading-[.92] transition-colors group-hover:text-lime sm:text-4xl">{videos[0].title}</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-mist">Zobacz, jak wygląda świadoma praca z AI od pierwszego promptu aż po produkcyjny workflow.</p></div></a>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between border border-white/10 bg-[#d6fc68] p-7 text-ink sm:p-9"><div><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-ink/60">398 filmów</p><h2 class="display mt-12 text-5xl leading-[.87] sm:text-6xl">Zostań na dłużej.</h2><p class="mt-7 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-ink/75">Subskrybuj kanał i wracaj po kolejne spojrzenia na programowanie, narzędzia oraz rozwój.</p></div><a class="mt-12 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-ink pb-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em]" href="https://www.youtube.com/@przeprogramowani?sub_confirmation=1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Subskrybuj kanał <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-y hairline bg-panel py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="site-container"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 border-b hairline pb-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-end"><div><div class="eyebrow">Najnowsze filmy</div><h2 class="display mt-5 text-5xl leading-[.9] sm:text-6xl">Włącz, kiedy chcesz.</h2></div><p class="max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-mist">Krótkie formaty, długie rozmowy i live'y z konkretami.</p></div><div class="mt-10 grid gap-x-5 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">{videos.slice(1).map((video) => <a class="group" href={`https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=${video.id}`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><div class="relative aspect-video overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-[#1a211d]"><img class="h-full w-full object-cover opacity-80 grayscale transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:grayscale-0" src={`https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${video.id}/hqdefault.jpg`} alt={video.title} loading="lazy" /><span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-ink/90 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-cream">{video.duration}</span><span class="absolute left-3 top-3 grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-lime text-sm text-ink opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100">↗</span></div><p class="mt-5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-lime">{video.category} · {video.date}</p><h3 class="display mt-2 text-2xl leading-[.92] transition-colors group-hover:text-lime">{video.title}</h3></a>)}</div></div></section>

    <section class="site-container py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-24"><div><div class="eyebrow text-coral">Serie tematyczne</div><h2 class="display mt-6 text-5xl leading-[.9] sm:text-6xl">Wejdź głębiej.</h2></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><a class="group border border-white/10 bg-panel p-6 transition-colors hover:border-lime/50" href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfE0DpqEANZ0CQ9pCGlxGKPvYb1Sj6ybV" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-lime">01 / PLAYLIST</span><h3 class="display mt-12 text-3xl">Przeprogramowani.ts</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">Darmowa mini-seria poświęcona TypeScriptowi.</p><span class="mt-7 inline-block text-xs font-bold text-lime">Otwórz playlistę ↗</span></a><a class="group border border-white/10 bg-panel p-6 transition-colors hover:border-coral/50" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/przeprogramowani" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-coral">02 / KANAŁ</span><h3 class="display mt-12 text-3xl">Rozwój programisty</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">Technika, nauka i kariera bez gotowych recept.</p><span class="mt-7 inline-block text-xs font-bold text-coral">Zobacz więcej ↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  </main>
</Layout>
